        <briefdescription>
<para>Homogenizes per-microplane normal and in-plane shear tangents to the macroscopic tangent, in Voigt notation. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>Approximates the continuum microplane virtual-work homogenization over the unit hemisphere <formula id="303">$ \Omega $</formula> of the macroscopic tangent, in tensor (index) notation:      <formula id="337">\[  \frac{\partial \sigma_{ij}}{\partial \varepsilon_{kl}} = \frac{3}{2\pi} \int_\Omega \left(
      N_{ij} \frac{\partial \sigma_N}{\partial \varepsilon_{kl}}
    + M_{ij} \frac{\partial \sigma_M}{\partial \varepsilon_{kl}}
    + L_{ij} \frac{\partial \sigma_L}{\partial \varepsilon_{kl}} \right) \, d\Omega
\]</formula> approximated by the quadrature sum actually evaluated here (see <ref refid="class_marmot_1_1_continuum_mechanics_1_1_microplane_1_1_n_t_split_1ae32dc8189cbfce09adcf8dec27c140ef" kindref="member">homogenizeStress</ref> for how the hemisphere-integral normalization is absorbed into the weights <formula id="323">$ w^{(m)} $</formula>). <parameterlist kind="templateparam"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>T</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Scalar type of the per-microplane tangents (see <ref refid="class_marmot_1_1_continuum_mechanics_1_1_microplane_1_1_n_t_split_1ae32dc8189cbfce09adcf8dec27c140ef" kindref="member">homogenizeStress</ref>). </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
