<parameternamelist>
<parametername>dSigNddStrain</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Per-microplane normal-direction tangent  <formula id="338">$ \partial \sigma_N^{(m)} /
\partial \boldsymbol{\varepsilon} $</formula>, size <formula id="339">$ 6 \times n_{qp} $</formula>; taken by value since each row is scaled in place by the integration weight before contraction. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>dSigMddStrain</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
