/ \partial \boldsymbol{\varepsilon} $</formula>, size <formula id="339">$ 6 \times n_{qp} $</formula>. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>dSigLddStrain</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Per-microplane <formula id="328">$ L $</formula>-direction tangent  <formula id="341">$ \partial \sigma_L^{(m)}
/ \partial \boldsymbol{\varepsilon} $</formula>, size <formula id="339">$ 6 \times n_{qp} $</formula>. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
